# Host trust material bind-mounted into containers (CA certificates and the
# like). The README explains what belongs here; nothing else is committed.
# secrets/* rather than secrets/: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so a negation inside one never applies and the README could not
# be committed to explain what the directory is for.
secrets/*
!secrets/README.md
